{"id":"de630da3be5fd670","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-term-model.md","title":"Term Model","display":"df-term-model — Term Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-term-model","aliases":["57-df-term-model"],"display":"df-term-model — Term Model","depends_on":["[[57-df-maxcon]]","[[57-df-provable]]","[[57-df-term]]","[[57-df-henkin-witness]]","[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-term-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-term-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-model — Term Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e892c7a9bb01feb5\" href=\"?note=e892c7a9bb01feb5\" title=\"57-df-maxcon\">57-df-maxcon</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"973e8f8c36bdfa9d\" href=\"?note=973e8f8c36bdfa9d\" title=\"57-df-provable\">57-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e8a3ea6c384666db\" href=\"?note=e8a3ea6c384666db\" title=\"57-df-henkin-witness\">57-df-henkin-witness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S&#39;}\">\\(\\Phi^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S&#39;}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxCon}(\\Phi^*)\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxCon}(\\Phi^*)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Henkin}(\\Phi^*)\">\\(\\mathrm{Henkin}(\\Phi^*)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e892c7a9bb01feb5\" href=\"?note=e892c7a9bb01feb5\" title=\"57-df-maxcon\">57-df-maxcon</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e8a3ea6c384666db\" href=\"?note=e8a3ea6c384666db\" title=\"57-df-henkin-witness\">57-df-henkin-witness</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathrm{HU}(S&#39;)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(T=\\mathrm{HU}(S&#39;)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a>。</li>\n<li>等号为对象语言构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,t_i\\in T\">\\(s,t,t_i\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_{S&#39;}\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_{S&#39;}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_k(S&#39;)\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_k(S&#39;)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S&#39;)\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S&#39;)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。结构采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a> 的有序对表示。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ns\\sim t&amp;\\longleftrightarrow(s\\doteq t)\\in\\Phi^*,\\\\\n[t]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:s\\sim t\\},\\qquad\nT/{\\sim}\\coloneqq\\{[t]:t\\in T\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal I(c)&amp;\\coloneqq[c],\\\\\n\\mathcal I(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle[t_1],\\ldots,[t_k]\\rangle,[f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)]\\rangle:\n\\langle t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\rangle\\in T^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal I(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle[t_1],\\ldots,[t_k]\\rangle:\\langle t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\rangle\\in T^k\n\\land R(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in\\Phi^*\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak T(\\Phi^*)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle T/{\\sim},\\mathcal I\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ns\\sim t&amp;\\longleftrightarrow(s\\doteq t)\\in\\Phi^*,\\\\\n[t]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:s\\sim t\\},\\qquad\nT/{\\sim}\\coloneqq\\{[t]:t\\in T\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal I(c)&amp;\\coloneqq[c],\\\\\n\\mathcal I(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle[t_1],\\ldots,[t_k]\\rangle,[f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)]\\rangle:\n\\langle t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\rangle\\in T^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal I(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle[t_1],\\ldots,[t_k]\\rangle:\\langle t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\rangle\\in T^k\n\\land R(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in\\Phi^*\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak T(\\Phi^*)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle T/{\\sim},\\mathcal I\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>T 是闭项集合，不是“属于项集的一个项”。极大一致性及等号规则保证等价关系、函数图单值和关系解释不依赖代表元；Henkin 条件用于满足定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-maxcon","status":"resolved","id":"e892c7a9bb01feb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-maxcon]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-provable","status":"resolved","i